cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this repository, please cite the associated research paper and this software repository."
type: software
title: "BD-AgroClim"
version: "1.0.0"
date-released: 2026-08-11

abstract: >
  BD-AgroClim is the computational research repository accompanying a
  study of reanalysis bias, terrain controls, machine-learning bias
  correction, and daily agro-climatic reconstruction for Bangladesh.
  The study evaluates NASA POWER and ERA5-Land against 36 Bangladesh
  Meteorological Department stations, investigates terrain and
  land-surface controls on reanalysis error, applies statistical and
  machine-learning correction methods, and evaluates spatial
  transferability using leave-one-station-out validation.

